# LF in the repository and LF on checkout, on every platform. Without this the line endings depend
# on each contributor's core.autocrlf, which turns into whole-file diffs that hide the real change.
#
# `text=auto` alone only normalises what is stored; it still checks out CRLF on Windows. Pinning the
# checkout too is what makes a file byte-identical wherever it is cloned.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.zip binary
